        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><img alt=\"Alliance\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/25/Alliance_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620204931\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lord Geoffery Tulvan</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/bf/Lord_Geoffery_Tulvan.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160131141854\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lord Geoffery Tulvan\"><img alt=\"Image of Lord Geoffery Tulvan\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/bf/Lord_Geoffery_Tulvan.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20160131141854\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"254\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lord Geoffery Tulvan.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Geoffery_Tulvan.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Worgen\" title=\"Worgen\">Worgen</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n30-35 Elite</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Class</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Warrior\" title=\"Warrior\">Warrior</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(faction)\" title=\"Gilneas (faction)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Crucible_of_Carnage\" title=\"Crucible of Carnage\">Crucible of Carnage</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Twilight_Highlands\" title=\"Twilight Highlands\">Twilight Highlands</a><span><span class=\"tttemplatelink coords-link noexcerpt\" data-coords=\"/way 48.8 59.6\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twilight_Highlands\" title=\"Twilight Highlands\"><sup>[48.8,&#160;59.6]</sup></a></span><span style=\"display:none;\"><span class=\"ZoneMap\" style=\"position:relative;width:300px;height:200px;display:block\"><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WorldMap-TwilightHighlands.jpg\" data-image-key=\"WorldMap-TwilightHighlands.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/WorldMap-TwilightHighlands.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20121223052121\" /></span></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:48.8%;top:59.6%;line-height:0;margin:-5.5px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blip.png\" data-image-key=\"Blip.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/f4/Blip.png/revision/latest?cb=20101220042049\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Companion(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Tulvan_Manservant\" title=\"Tulvan Manservant\">Tulvan Manservants</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Servant_of_Lord_Geoffery\" title=\"Servant of Lord Geoffery\">Servants</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Geoffery Tulvan</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Worgen\" title=\"Worgen\">worgen</a> located at the <a href=\"/wiki/Crucible_of_Carnage\" title=\"Crucible of Carnage\">Crucible of Carnage</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Twilight_Highlands\" title=\"Twilight Highlands\">Twilight Highlands</a>. He is one of the challengers and seeks to become the greatest warrior in the world. He is strong enough to lift his own carriage. Once he turns, he is known as <b>Lord Geoffery Wildwolf</b>.\n</p><p>He summons three <a href=\"/wiki/Servant_of_Lord_Geoffery\" title=\"Servant of Lord Geoffery\">servants</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective_of\">Objective of</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"N\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/cb/Neutral_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620220434\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;[30-35G5]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Crucible_of_Carnage:_The_Earl_of_Evisceration!\" title=\"The Crucible of Carnage: The Earl of Evisceration!\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">The Crucible of Carnage: The Earl of Evisceration!</span></a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Abilities\">Abilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span id=\"Ability:Death&#95;by&#95;Peasant\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Spell shadow summonvoidwalker\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spell shadow summonvoidwalker.png\" data-image-key=\"Spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/5/55/Spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20060923203548\" /></span></span>&#160;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/?spell=88619\"><b>Death by Peasant</b></a></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Calls forth 3 servants of the House Barov<sup>&#91;<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Sic\" title=\"Template:Sic\"><span title=\"Indicates that an inaccuracy was present in the original quote.\">sic</span></a>&#93;</sup> that will fight, cook, and clean for you.</span></li>\n<li><span id=\"Ability:Undying&#95;Frenzy\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Ability hunter pet crab\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Ability hunter pet crab.png\" data-image-key=\"Ability_hunter_pet_crab.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/4/42/Ability_hunter_pet_crab.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20180824001710\" /></span></span>&#160;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/?spell=80514\"><b>Undying Frenzy</b></a></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Chops, dices and minces your enemy.</span></li>\n<li><span id=\"Ability:Undying&#95;Frenzy\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Ability mount whitedirewolf\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Ability mount whitedirewolf.png\" data-image-key=\"Ability_mount_whitedirewolf.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/fa/Ability_mount_whitedirewolf.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20180824002938\" /></span></span>&#160;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/?spell=88616\"><b>Undying Frenzy</b></a></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Chops, dices and minces your enemy in 5 sec sec.</span></li>\n<li><span id=\"Ability:Uppercut\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Inv gauntlets 05\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv gauntlets 05.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_gauntlets_05.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/0/08/Inv_gauntlets_05.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20061005114002\" /></span></span>&#160;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/?spell=80182\"><b>Uppercut</b></a></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Inflicts 110% weapon damage to an enemy, knocking it back.</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"noexcerpt\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/The_Crucible_of_Carnage:_The_Earl_of_Evisceration!#Notes\" title=\"The Crucible of Carnage: The Earl of Evisceration!\">The Crucible of Carnage: The Earl of Evisceration!#Notes</a></i></span></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.0.3a\" title=\"Patch 4.0.3a\">Patch 4.0.3a</a> (2010-11-23):</b> Added.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<tab